WEBVTT

00:02:27.894 --> 00:02:30.062
It's something we ought to all know,

00:02:30.104 --> 00:02:32.732
but actually it's very
easy to forget today.

00:02:33.274 --> 00:02:34.901
But secondly,

00:02:34.942 --> 00:02:37.737
empathizing with another way
of looking at the world

00:02:37.778 --> 00:02:42.366
can help you to understand
yourself better as well.

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:46.704
And the reason is that there’s
a wonderful proverb which says:

00:02:46.746 --> 00:02:48.497
A fish can’t see water.

00:02:48.915 --> 00:02:50.583
A fish can’t see water.

00:02:51.042 --> 00:02:53.878
None of us can see
the assumptions that shape us

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.339
unless we jump out of our fish bowl,

00:02:56.339 --> 00:03:00.551
go to somewhere completely different,
talk to other fish,